Vālin rebukes Tārā and scorns enduring insult --- Vālin trusts righteous Rāma can do no wrong --- Vālin orders women back and vows victorious return --- Tārā circumambulates weeping and seeks blessings indoors --- Vālin exits hissing and confronts blazing Sugrīva --- Brothers trade deadly fist threats and blows --- Sugrīva slams sāla on Vālin like thunderbolt --- Vālin overpowers flagging Sugrīva who shows agility --- Rāma buries venomous shaft in Vālin chest --- Vālin collapses senseless like felled Indra banner